Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
The result is a connected five-tensor random network with mixed ranks \[Dash] \
some legs are shared bonds and two are free legs that will survive the \
contraction. The first call asks for a path with all defaults; the algorithm \
is deterministic when no temperature is supplied, so repeated calls return \
the same path:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"faf8bbf2-1e3b-44a8-a7a7-f911be98fa7f"],

